        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. When an employee is employed at more than one rate of pay, overtime earned at the time and one-half rate may be calculated based on the employee's average hourly rate or based on the rate in effect when the overtime is worked, at the option of the University.",
