                    1646.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Compensatory time off shall be scheduled by the University and taken within two (2) six (6) month bank periods (December 1 - May 31; June 1 - November 30). Banked compensatory time off which is not paid or scheduled within the bank period in which it is earned or in the bank period following that in which it is earned shall be paid in the next regularly scheduled pay period at the employee's then current rate unless an extension has been granted by mutual consent of the employee and the University.",
